OL,3,ASir Mel Stride and Priti Patel replaced
OL,4,Ain major Tory reshuffle
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaire Coutinho, previously the shadow
OL,7,Fenergy secretary, after her maternity
OL,8,Fleave will replace Griffith as shadow
OL,9,Fbusiness secretary and act as his
OL,10,Fdeputy in the ongoing shake-up.
